      "distance_upper_basis": "Author operational: retained historical 3.5 A near-attack screen. NDPK papers establish ND1 attack and positioning, not this numeric limit. Creatine-kinase computed N-to-P pre-reactant distance 3.49 A is cross-system context only.",
      "distance_lower_basis": "Author operational pre-reactant guard, not a paper-derived NDPK lower limit. Newly excludes an already collapsed N-P contact; general clash testing remains independent.",
