    "history": "3.5 A/150 degree historical classifications were already known. Lower guard and independent non-reactive site assignment added before the fresh package replay. This is not preregistration. User approved adding the three-contact Mg rule in this thread before this V2 scoring. All V1 axis thresholds and general checks remain unchanged; historical samples and their diagnostic distances existed beforehand. During initial implementation QA, one-way assignment mislabeled remote Mg ions as additional Mg at restored sites. Reciprocal nearest matching replaces this attribution before final replay, with the initial audit preserved. The 1.8-2.6 A window and all oxygen definitions are unchanged. This refinement is retrospective and is not described as preregistered.",
